WEBVTT

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:30.569
that honor the shameful practices

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:34.906
that created the inequality
that low status-communities experience.

00:16:35.991 --> 00:16:39.745
If we use the tools
of capitalism that we have,

00:16:39.745 --> 00:16:44.416
but in a much more restorative way,

00:16:44.458 --> 00:16:48.253
we can help people
in low-status communities show

00:16:48.295 --> 00:16:52.090
that you don't have to move
out of our neighborhoods

00:16:52.132 --> 00:16:53.800
to live in better ones.

00:16:54.342 --> 00:16:55.635
Thank you.

00:16:55.635 --> 00:17:02.601
(Applause and cheers)